      "eyebrow": "The honest version",
      "heading": "Joblogic is a serious platform",
      "text": "We are not going to pretend Joblogic is bad or over-built for the sake of it. It is a mature field-service management suite: planned maintenance, scheduling, dispatch, asset management, quotes and invoicing. If you need to run a whole maintenance or service operation end to end, Joblogic is built for exactly that and does it well. Quickler is a different category. It does not do scheduling or invoicing and it is not trying to. It is the lightweight, no-app layer that captures inspections and compliance records on site, in WhatsApp. If you need full field-service management, Joblogic is the right tool. If you just need inspections captured without an app, that is us."
    },
